":""},"cinematic_dialogue:21:1511456003:":{"text":"现在不是沮丧的时候！","source_cn":"现在不是沮丧的时候！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8B1C42D7954797C8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"现在不是沮丧的时候！","female":"现在不是沮丧的时候！","variant_male_record_index":"191397","variant_female_record_index":"191398","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1511455001:0":{"text":"你……你对顿做了什么？！他是你的信徒！","source_cn":"你……你对顿做了什么？！他是你的信徒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C0AE8A4443007C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1511455002:0":{"text":"真正的猎手，要会正确评估猎物的力量。","source_cn":"真正的猎手，要会正确评估猎物的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86B6D40FD5BFD4AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1511455003:0":{"text":"能死在我手中，是他的荣幸。","source_cn":"能死在我手中，是他的荣幸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2897853F4B5963B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1511455004:0":{"text":"比起那些死于自相残杀的战士，至少我见证了他的勇气。你该为他感到高兴。","source_cn":"比起那些死于自相残杀的战士，至少我见证了他的勇气。你该...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DCE9D3C6272F4D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1511455005:0":{"text":"你知道其他人在互相残杀……为什么不阻止他们？！","source_cn":"你知道其他人在互相残杀……为什么不阻止他们？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59736582FF7BAFC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1511455006:0":{"text":"还有那个恶魔！她搅乱了整个猎血节！","source_cn":"还有那个恶魔！她搅乱了整个猎血节！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D9020E0EC5E58C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1511455007:0":{"text":"你们——雅库伯尔人，是我的造物。你们和丛林里的野兽一样，存在的唯一意义就是取悦我。","source_cn":"你们——雅库伯尔人，是我的造物。你们和丛林里的野兽一样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FF935B932400A2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1511455008:0":{"text":"你们应当将一切都敬献给我！鲜血、惨叫——还有生命！","source_cn":"你们应当将一切都敬献给我！鲜血、惨叫——还有生命！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x862BD2C9A4072695","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1511455009:0":{"text":"那个恶魔？她做了些有意思的事，让战士互相猎杀，才能决出最强的猎手。","source_cn":"那个恶魔？她做了些有意思的事，让战士互相猎杀，才能决出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6670B21D0492DE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1511455010:0":{"text":"她的存在不值一提，但她所做的事可博我一笑，不枉来这世间一回。","source_cn":"她的存在不值一提，但她所做的事可博我一笑，不枉来这世间一回。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD4F7D437FB